aboot does not touch the console by itself.  It uses SRM calls for all
console access, so aboot will not change the video mode.

You can always use the framebuffer console, and set whatever
resolution you want.  Another option is to set a different console
font with "setfont".  Most distributions already do this in some init
script, so you'll just need to change some setting somewhere.

